dragging me down

284
00:12:33,446 --> 00:12:35,529
Got these
chains on me

285
00:12:35,569 --> 00:12:37,372
Hear that
clanking sound

286
00:12:37,412 --> 00:12:39,615
Got these
chains on me

287
00:12:39,655 --> 00:12:41,777
Mister
hear my song

288
00:12:41,939 --> 00:12:45,904
You say imagination is morally wrong

289
00:13:03,965 --> 00:13:05,887
The man won
't hear it

290
00:13:05,927 --> 00:13:09,690
That big boss man
is trying to crush my spirit

291
00:13:09,730 --> 00:13:11,612
Got these
chains on me

292
00:13:11,652 --> 00:13:13,414
They won't
let me fly

293
00:13:13,454 --> 00:13:15,576
Got these
chains on me

294
00:13:15,616 --> 00:13:17,377
